an class="card-index">02</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-khuha/">Wat Khuha Phimuk (the cave hill temple)</a></h3><p>Small details that invite you to pause and look.</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดปทุมธารา (วัดหน้าเมือง)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-pathum/"><img src="/assets/wat-pathum.webp" alt="วัดปทุมธารา (วัดหน้าเมือง)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">03</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-pathum/">Wat Pathum Thara (the front town temple)</a></h3><p>Old ordination hall and waterway stories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดคงคาภิมุข (วัดคงคา)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/"><img src="/assets/wat-kongkha.webp" alt="วัดคงคาภิมุข (วัดคงคา)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">04</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/">Wat Kongkha Phimuk (the riverside temple)</a></h3><p>Southern Thai style ordination hall details</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/"><img src="/assets/wat-nikorn.webp" alt="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" width="1000" height="726" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">05</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a></h3><p>The temple and community memories</p></