+ None, '01 / Old buildings', 'Tao Ming School ↗', 'Community faith ↗', 'A window into the past ↗', 'Shrine', 'Old house', 'Riverside market', '01 / Read the town', 'Best for a half-day visit', '02 / Read the town', 'Open the town map', '03 / Read the town', '04 / Read the town', 'Year-round traditions · Timing from the source documents', 'Check each year’s schedule before travelling', '05 / Eat and shop for souvenirs in the district', 'Food', 'The town’s story', 'Where this information comes from · Takuapa 101', None, 'There are many more pages to tell', 'A guide from Baan Siwara', 'Takuapa 101 was created by', 'Baan Siwara', 'in Takuapa to bring together places, traditions, and shops in the town for readers to explore in sequence', 'Siwara Cafe is a teak house in the old market district, recognizable by its wooden gable, colored glass, and traditional old wooden doors. It stands at 53 Rat Bamrung Road. We hope this wooden house will help people get to know the town more deeply.', 'The Takuapa Municipality brochure is the source for information on 20 places, 7 traditions, and 59 shops, 86 entries in total, extracted on 6 September 2026', 'Before you travel', 'The source documents do not state a publication date, so the website has not verified current opening hours, admission fees, shop status, or event schedules. Contact the place or municipality to confirm details before travelling.', 'Takuapa Municipality’s promotional map is not to scale and its distances do not match the actual area. The website uses the source map image directly and lets you zoom or scroll to read it.', 'Eat and shop for souvenirs · Takuapa 101', None, 'Another taste of Takuapa', 'Eat, drink, and choose souvenirs from the old town district', '108 shops in Takuapa District', 'Show 108 shops', 'Khanom Jeen Pa Mom · Khanom Jeen Pa Mom', 'Khanom Jeen Phi Neng · Khanom Jeen Phi Neng']
+assert len(keys) == 45 and len(vals) == 45
+vals[6] = src[keys[6]].replace('หน้าแรก','Home').replace('ตะกั่วป่า 101','Takuapa 101')
+vals[26] = src[keys[26]].replace('หน้าแรก','Home').replace('ข้อมูลนี้มาจากไหน','Where this information comes from')
+vals[39] = src[keys[39]].replace('หน้าแรก','Home').replace('กินและของฝาก','Eat and souvenirs').replace('ฮกกี่เหลา','Hok Kee Lao').replace('ร้านหลกอั้น','Lok An Restaurant').replace('ข้าวมันไก่ป้าสุ','Pa Su Chicken Rice')
+out = dict(zip(keys, vals))
+Path('data/i18n/en/missing-parts/miss-dc14f4aa94.json').write_text(json.dumps(out, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\n', encoding='utf-8')

